%T A073361 4410,5326,6995,7350,9316,10880,12885,14986,16445,19530,22336,24995,
%U A073361 30345,31111,36080,43260,47491,53090,57345,65311,68945,78855,89071,90365,104370,117421
%N A073361 Nested floor product of n and fractions (k+1)/k for all k>0 (mod 4), divided by 4.
%H A073361 Qiyuan Gu, <a href="/A073361/b073361.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..10000</a>
%F A073361 a(n) = (1/4)*[...[[[[n(2/1)](3/2)](4/3)](6/5)]...(k+1)/k]..., k>0 (mod 4), where [x] = floor of x; this infinite nested floor product will eventually level-off at a(n).
%e A073361 a(1) = 1 since (1/4)*[[[[1(2/1)](3/2)](4/3)](6/5)] = (1/4)[4(6/5)] = 1.
%o A073361 (PARI) a(n) = {my(x=n, k=1); while(k <= x, if(k%4, x += x\k); k++); x/4}; \\ _Qiyuan Gu_, Aug 06 2026
%Y A073361 Cf. A042968, A073359, A073360.
%K A073361 easy,nonn,changed
